      "statement": "Following a label is implemented as app-owned state plus Spotify discovery: a Label row created by the user, discovery via the undocumented label:\"<name>\" album search filter (which matches fuzzily), and exact verification of each candidate's real label from the full album object (GET /albums/{id}) - the label field or, when absent, parsed from the copyrights array.",
