    {
      "id": "claim_7540d02eaea841028e3353c43da9a34e",
      "statement": "The release poller runs per followed label (PollOnceAsync iterates Labels and searches by label name), not per linked artist; artists linked at add-label time remain as anchors seeding the label's roster but no longer drive release discovery.",
