    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5d18d0ba684f4165b567a6b88ac4dee8",
      "statement": "Junction linking is enforced atomically in SQL: UpsertLabelAlbumAsync inserts the label_albums row only when the label's committed current name, re-read under a FOR KEY SHARE row lock, exactly equals the candidate's verified real label, so a poll pass carrying a stale pre-rename snapshot can never link or resurrect a mismatched album.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Features/Releases/Polling/ReleasePoller.cs#L438-L475",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:64f7a414e13f03c5561d0765e72da30507a2be0d99e3d7bd0c491a2614485094:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e6254998651c46098b6c02f46b2c08f9",
      "statement": "A positively verified real-label mismatch deletes the album's existing junction link (self-heal), and this is the only deletion path for label_albums rows besides the rename-time audit: unverifiable candidates or transient search misses never cause deletions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Features/Releases/Polling/ReleasePoller.cs#L247-L293",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cc9b0a5668eddc4d427f6e510b7fdd671ae0fc8a9ad0d4f16890e4a1aa1601de:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2415cf4d565e46159d9484ceafce058c",
      "statement": "Renaming a label retargets the follow: inside the same transaction, AuditLabelLinksAsync re-verifies every existing link against the new name - exact matches are kept with corrected attribution, verified mismatches and 404 albums are unlinked, and any unverifiable link throws LabelLinkAuditIncompleteException, rolling the whole rename back so the label keeps its old name and all releases (API returns 503).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/katalog-api/src/Katalog.Api/Features/Labels/UpdateLabel.cs#L22-L97",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:46e60154bebb496c32e0313cb6b9208a6105ff3a6d3f1f373d50e8e7ba67c3f2:"
        },
