    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2b7a312c7a48405bb959cf7df63893fb",
      "statement": "Release polling is crash-safe and idempotent: albums upsert ON CONFLICT (spotify_id), a singleton PollCursor row (job name artist_new_releases, kept from the artist-polling era) records the last successful cycle, a single label's failure never kills the cycle, and ReleasesPollingService polls once at startup then on a PeriodicTimer with a 6-24 h interval (default 12 h).",
